From 1634cdefb86e996e05edc7646f1ab546adc180cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: a52sxq-kernel <a52sxq-kernel@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:23:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/17] Input: add ST FingerTip 5 (FTS5) touchscreen driver

Driver for the STMicroelectronics FTS5CU56A as used in the Samsung
Galaxy A52s 5G. The upstream stmfts driver speaks the FingerTip 4
protocol (0x85/0x86 event reads, event id in byte 0) and does not work
with this part.

The power-on sequence follows the vendor driver: system reset through
a register write (there is no reset line), wait for the controller
ready event, read the firmware version and device id, select the touch
types, run the RAM-only forced calibration, clear the event FIFO and
start mutual + self sensing, each command checked against its echo
event. Events are read from the FIFO with plain I2C transfers (more
than 32 bytes at once, which SMBus block reads cannot do) and reported
as type-B multitouch with palm as MT_TOOL_PALM.

Based on the woa-a52s stmfts_fts5cu56a driver and Samsung's FTS5
driver. There is no firmware update path: the IC keeps the firmware it
has in flash. The identity read at probe is printed and exported in
sysfs (chip_id, fw_version, config_version, main_version).
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/Kconfig   |  12 +
 drivers/input/touchscreen/Makefile  |   1 +
 drivers/input/touchscreen/stmfts5.c | 646 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 659 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/input/touchscreen/stmfts5.c

diff --git a/drivers/input/touchscreen/Kconfig b/drivers/input/touchscreen/Kconfig
index 5810b1d45..ea6919e07 100644
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/Kconfig
@@ -1251,6 +1251,18 @@ config TOUCHSCREEN_STMFTS
 	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
 	  module will be called stmfts.
 
+config TOUCHSCREEN_STMFTS5
+	tristate "STMicroelectronics FingerTip 5 (FTS5) touchscreen"
+	depends on I2C
+	help
+	  Say Y here if you have a STMicroelectronics FingerTip 5
+	  touchscreen controller such as the FTS5CU56A (Samsung Galaxy
+	  A52s 5G). The older FingerTip parts are handled by the
+	  TOUCHSCREEN_STMFTS driver.
+
+	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
+	  module will be called stmfts5.
+
 config TOUCHSCREEN_STMPE
 	tristate "STMicroelectronics STMPE touchscreens"
 	depends on MFD_STMPE
diff --git a/drivers/input/touchscreen/Makefile b/drivers/input/touchscreen/Makefile
index 153dc1b7c..7763a0d3c 100644
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/Makefile
@@ -82,6 +82,7 @@ obj-$(CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_SILEAD)	+= silead.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_SIS_I2C)	+= sis_i2c.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_ST1232)	+= st1232.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_STMFTS)	+= stmfts.o
